---
import CommitLayout from '../layouts/CommitLayout.astro';

---



<CommitLayout>
	<article class="prose max-w-none">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6">
			Tekne
		</h2>
		
		<p>
			Tekne is a freestyle productivity app in the shape of an outline editor.
		</p>
		
		<h3>Freeform data over time</h3>
		
		
		<p>
			Tekne's core feature is that it allows you to track data over time in a free-form way.
		</p>

		<p>
			Tag data with <span class="font-mono">#tags</span> and get an aggregated view over time automatically.
		</p>

		<video
			class="w-full rounded-xl border border-white/[0.06] mt-4"
			src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77cdbda3-b077-4fac-a3c6-a91b4ce5e574"
			width="960"
			height="340"
			controls
			playsinline
			muted
			preload="metadata"
			aria-label="Tekne demo: track writing time across days and add a new session"
		>
			<a href="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77cdbda3-b077-4fac-a3c6-a91b4ce5e574">Watch the Tekne demo</a>
		</video>

		<p>
			The best place to learn more is the tutorial and documentation in the app.
		</p>

		<a href="https://demo.tekne.app" class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 rounded-md bg-raised px-3 py-1.5 font-medium text-text no-underline transition-colors hover:text-accent">
			Check out the demo
			<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="size-5">
				<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 8.25 21 12m0 0-3.75 3.75M21 12H3" />
			</svg>
		</a>
	</article>
</CommitLayout>
